node_modules
# Keep environment variables out of version control
.env

/generated/prisma
.vercel
.env*
# ...except the example, which is documentation, not a secret. `vercel link`
# appends a bare `.env*`, and that swallowed the storefront's example when it
# was moved into this repo — the app arrived with no record of what it needs to
# start. Tracked deliberately.
!.env.example
